tanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T12:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T11:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T20:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Category":"Film","attribute_FilmCountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_FilmGenre":"Drama","attribute_Promoter":"AltitudeFilms","attribute_Rating":"PG","attribute_SupplementaryEvent":false},{"description":"1.BEST OF RIK MAYAL10 mins\r\n\r\nFeaturing  clips  from BAD NEWS, MR JOLLY, and FISTFUL OF TRAVELLERS CHEQUES \r\n\r\n2.RED NOSE OF COURAGE 53 mins\r\n\r\nEx PM John Major (Ade Edmondson) runs away from the circus to become an MP.  Under pressure from his Dad, the circus manager, (Alexei Sayle) Major is obliged to work evenings as part of a clown act, even when he’s Prime Minister. But then he falls for the Opposition Leader (Dawn French) \r\n\r\nINTERVAL\r\n\r\n3. BEST OF STELLA STREET 25 mins\r\nScenes from the hit BBC series starring PHIL CORNWELL and JOHN SESSIONS\r\n\r\nLIVE Q&A with PETER RICHARDSON and PHIL CORNWELL\r\n\r\n4. FOUR MEN IN A CAR 28 mins\r\n\r\nFour salesmen heading to a conference in Swindon have the journey from hell, involving road-rage, a snowstorm, food poisoning and a farmer’s wife wielding a shotgun.\r\nStarring Rik Mayal, Nigel Planer, Ade Edmondson and Peter Richardson.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":225,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Comic Strip Presents...Screening & Q&A","instanceDates":"5 November-5 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"330601ALMKNHRTSPBLHHBNTLPGSCCPMCB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-05T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-05T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-05T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-05T19:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_Category":"Film","attribute_FilmCountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_FilmGenre":"Comedy","attribute_Rating":"15","attribute_SupplementaryEvent":false,"attribute_Promoter":""},{"description":"","htmlDesc